{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gHCvJ2uQm11795254495.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>新界東醫院聯網為約800名前線醫護人員提供臨床溝通培訓，以加強與病人及家屬之間的溝通。</p><p></p><p>聯網邀請臨床心理學家為醫護人員提供臨床溝通培訓。首場培訓上周在那打素醫院舉行，沙田醫院及威爾斯親王醫院等醫護人員以網上形式參與培訓。</p><p></p><p>聯網希望藉此推動前線醫護更主動、耐心地與病人及家屬交流，照顧他們的情緒，讓後續的醫療講解更有效進行，從而建立醫患互信關係。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:43:50.651905+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T02:35:09.817105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:37:14.865951+00:00","content_hash":"3f0572361fdc44b826f9e23e924241dbe2ec3f7901133c58c2b7fa7d8f649280","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}